@fact thorne.storm
# en: Rumoured to have once out-duelled a storm.
text [fa9226] = 据说他曾在决斗中打败过一场风暴。

@fact thorne.lost
# en: He lost to the storm, badly. Losing well, he says, is the only thing worth teaching.
text [f094e4] = 他输给了那场风暴，输得很惨。他说，好好地输，是唯一值得教的东西。

@fact thorne.roses
# en: He tends a tiny walled rose garden behind the observatory at dawn and talks to the roses.
text [ec7ccc] = 黎明时分，他在观星台后面一座小小的围墙玫瑰园里打理花草，还对玫瑰说话。

@fact thorne.hands
# en: His hands have started to shake. Age comes for every storm eventually.
text [95c9a9] = 他的手开始发抖了。岁月终究会找上每一场风暴。

@fact thorne.rival
# en: A flamboyant old wizard in purple has wanted a rematch with him for forty years.
text [054b17] = 一个穿紫袍、作派浮夸的老巫师，四十年来一直想跟他再比一场。

@fact thorne.letters
# en: He writes very few letters of recommendation, and the Conclave reads every one.
text [067d68] = 他很少写推荐信，而七塔议会每一封都会读。
